Package: local.duobar.rootless
Name: DuoBar (Rootless)
Version: 0.2.7
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: DuoBar circular battery, Wi-Fi and cellular indicator for iOS 16 Rootless.
 Includes a live adjustable 70%-140% size slider, Settings integration,
 charging and Low Power Mode colors, and Control Center layout improvements.
 Includes hotspot/Control Center fixes and Settings bug reports.
 Rootless build is verified but still requires on-device testing.
Maintainer: RBx9
Author: RBx9
Homepage: https://github.com/RBx9/DuoBar
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 16.0), firmware (<< 17.0)
Conflicts: local.duobar
Tag: role::tweak
